<title>ALBANIA: Albanian September CPI rises 2.5 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Albanian September CPI rises 2.5 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania's Institute of Statistics reported the following economic indicator details on Wednesday:</p>
<p> ALBANIAN INFLATION	 SEPT 96     AUG 96     SEPT 95</p>
<p> Monthly CPI change (pct)   +2.5	  +1.9	 +1.5</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change	     +17.7	 +16.1	 +6.5</p>
<p> Index (Dec 1993=100)	139.34	135.99     118.83</p>
<p>-- Tirana newsroom +355-42-62228</p>
</text>
